## SFIF Stage

Current stage: **{{sfif_stage}}**.

| SFIF Stage | Definition | Done When | This project's status |
|---|---|---|---|
| Scaffold | Directory structure, file stubs, conventions in place | Type sketches compile; no business logic | {{scaffold_status}} |
| Foundation | Project installs reliably, idempotent, integrity check passes | `install --dry-run` + `--check` clean; integrity check green | {{foundation_status}} |
